    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so heavy. like i wake up and realize i have absolutely nowhere to go and no one to talk to. i feel like a ghost in my own life. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i just didn't have to deal with this weight anymore. if i could just stop feeling this way.",
